entries[229233] = { ["name"] = "Enforcer's Backalley Shoulderplates", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Plate\n6132 Armor\n+2,452 [Strength or Intellect]\n+14,597 Stamina\n+ 447 Critical Strike\n+ 961 Haste\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warrior\nUnderpin Strongarm's Muscle (0/5)\nEnforcer's Backalley Vestplate\nEnforcer's Backalley Crushers\nEnforcer's Backalley Faceshield\nEnforcer's Backalley Chausses\nEnforcer's Backalley Shoulderplates\n(2) Set Arms: Your abilities have a chance to begin a Winning Streak! , increasing the damage of Overpower by 5%, stacking up to 10 times.\nOverpower has a 15% chance to end your Winning Streak!\n(2) Set Fury: Your abilities have a chance to start a Winning Streak! , increasing the damage of Rampage by 2%, stacking up to 10 times.\nRampage has a 15% chance to end your Winning Streak!\n(2) Set Protection: Each time you take damage you have a chance to cast Shield Wall for 4.0 sec and gain Luck of the Draw! , which increases your damage dealt by 15% for 12 sec.\n(4) Set Arms: When your Winning Streak! ends you gain 2% Haste and your Mortal Strike and Cleave damage is increased by 2% per stack of Winning Streak! you had for 12 sec.\n(4) Set Fury: When you gain a stack of Winning Streak! you have an even chance to either cause your next Bloodthirst to deal 15% increased damage and have 25% increased chance to critically strike or cause your next Raging Blow to deal 15% increased damage and generate 2 additional Rage.\n(4) Set Protection: During Luck of the Draw! Shield Slam's chance to critically strike is increased by 75% and its critical strikes reduce the cooldown of Shield Charge by 12.0 sec.\nSell Price:" }
