entries[229269] = { ["name"] = "Tireless Collector's Hunted Heads", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Mail\n4076 Armor\n+2,452 [Agility or Intellect]\n+14,597 Stamina\n+ 933 Haste\n+ 475 Versatility\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Hunter\nTireless Collector's Bounties (0/5)\nTireless Collector's Battlegear\nTireless Collector's Gauntlets\nTireless Collector's Chained Cowl\nTireless Collector's Armored Breeches\nTireless Collector's Hunted Heads\n(2) Set Beast Mastery: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that fires a Barbed Shot at 100% effectiveness. Casting Bestial Wrath always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Marksmanship: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that increases your auto shot damage by 200% and reduces the time between auto shots by 0.5 sec for 10 sec. Casting Trueshot always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Survival: Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate a Winning Streak! increasing the damage of your Wildfire Bomb by 3% stacking up to 6 times.\nWildfire Bomb has a 15% chance to end your Winning Streak! (Proc chance: 15%)\n(4) Set Beast Mastery: Hitting a Jackpot! infuses your pet with a mutagen, causing its auto-attacks to deal (12% of Attack Power) Nature damage to its target and up to 4 enemies within 10 yds for 8 sec. Mutagenic attacks reduce the cooldown of Bestial Wrath by 0.10 sec.\n(4) Set Marksmanship: Consuming Lock and Load also fires an Explosive Shot at 125% effectiveness.\n(4) Set Survival: When your Winning Streak! ends, your next [ Mongoose Bite / Raptor Strike] deals 400% increased damage and reduces the cooldown of Wildfire Bomb by 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
