entries[229341] = { ["name"] = "Aspectral Emissary's Arcane Vents", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Cloth\n1610 Armor\n+2,452 Intellect\n+14,597 Stamina\n+ 434 Versatility\n+ 974 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Mage\nJewels of the Aspectral Emissary (0/5)\nAspectral Emissary's Primal Robes\nAspectral Emissary's Hardened Grasp\nAspectral Emissary's Crystalline Cowl\nAspectral Emissary's Trousers\nAspectral Emissary's Arcane Vents\n(2) Set Arcane: Your spells and abilities have a small chance to hit a Jackpot! granting you Clearcasting and 5% increased spell damage for 12 sec. Casting Touch of the Magi has a 100% chance to hit a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Fire: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! reducing the cooldown of Combustion by 2 sec. Casting Combustion has a 100% chance to grant a Jackpot! at 100% increased effectiveness.\n(2) Set Frost: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that fires a Frostbolt Volley dealing [(124.74% of Spell Power) * 5] damage to your primary target and (124.74% of Spell Power) damage to up to 8 additional targets. Casting Icy Veins always hits a Jackpot!\n(4) Set Arcane: When you hit a Jackpot! , you also gain 3 stacks towards Aether Attunement.\n(4) Set Fire: When you hit a Jackpot! your damage is increased by 8% for 7 sec. If you would gain Jackpot! from Combustion the duration is increased by 100%.\n(4) Set Frost: Icy Veins causes you to hit a Jackpot! at 100% effectiveness every 10 sec for 30 sec.\nSell Price:" }
